temsで取れる情報でlinesでパースしても同じにはならないんだろうな...","ts":"1624154966.144200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cun4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"523ee624-e4b3-4970-a907-9f7d191eb79d","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"qfeditのend_lnum/col対応した","ts":"1624154950.143800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uYA6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7158d5f4-d0b6-49dc-96a4-74d039fa210d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ですねえ","ts":"1624154931.143300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qdRH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c51c1239-f980-4b90-96f9-90fc6f222fb8","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"位置とかtypeの文字列化など色々とありまして…","ts":"1624154924.143100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PKpE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04a053fc-64e1-4aea-b88f-7707677ea547","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あーでも、フルのテキストじゃないですね、これをgetqflist lines でフォーマットでもしないとだめか?","ts":"1624154868.142700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LsKa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a4c01c6f-cd06-4784-9a4b-e6ec2374adb7","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"こんな\n```.vimrc|25 col 3| \" user config setup {{{\n.vimrc|26 col 7| let g:user = {\n.vimrc|33 col 7| let g:user.system = {}\n...```\n quickfixのリスト状態で、`Capture PP getqflist({'items':[]})` した結果が\n```getqflist({'items':[]}) = {\n  'items': [\n    {'bufnr': 2, 'col': 3, 'lnum': 25, 'module': '', 'nr': 0, 'pattern': '', 'text': '\" user config setup {{{', 'type': '', 'valid': 1, 'vcol': 0},\n    {'bufnr': 2, 'col': 7, 'lnum': 26, 'module': '', 'nr': 0, 'pattern': '', 'text': 'let g:user = {', 'type': '', 'valid': 1, 'vcol': 0},\n    {'bufnr': 2, 'col': 7, 'lnum': 33, 'module': '', 'nr': 0, 'pattern': '', 'text': 'let g:user.system = {}', 'type': '', 'valid': 1, 'vcol': 0},\n...```\nなので、取れる?(あるいは私が課題を勘違いしてる?)","ts":"1624154806.142100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MQGY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73b0e6eb-2215-4e74-87c4-f631b7b04044","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あれ getqflist([{what}]) の items 指定だとどうなります?","ts":"1624154393.140600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UzZR2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4804a18d-df93-48b7-b1a6-2f3e28faaa72","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"ですよね、まあ実装見て再現するだけなのでそんなに難しくないか","ts":"1624154341.140200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HKmu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"347770d4-35b9-4811-b5c9-1756a9dea9dd","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"知る限りだとなさそう…あとバッファの各行はオプションでカスタマイズできます\nオプションが設定されていれば逆に関数呼び出せば得られるので楽だけど、デフォルトを取る方法がなさげ?","ts":"1624154109.139600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ty5Hg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97cb85e7-535c-49b0-a3ed-21f70b45f66d","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"getqflist/loclistの情報から[cl]openバッファーの各行を文字列で取得する方法ってないですかね","ts":"1624153173.137500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TzU2o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bd83824d-c1e6-41e0-8ea2-34104b131a62","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"誰感あるな","ts":"1624149104.136300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R2B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e521402c-efe5-4021-a369-172c225d374c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Shane-XB-Qianさん","ts":"1624149096.136200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cgsO="}]},{"client_msg_id":"54598190-48cf-4e37-bc36-faf9cfa40e5b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"環境によっては同じですが、それが保証はされない感じですね\n• long -\u0026gt; long intはintより大きい(同等でも可)が保証される\n• int -\u0026gt; その環境の最適な整数\nという感じ(雑)ですし","ts":"1624147743.135800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dpRLD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55dda647-aa93-46e4-95c1-f5bad8c561c5","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"(あれ、C の long と int って環境によってはそもそも同じだっけか)","ts":"1624147555.134600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1uw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57a24d8b-4e6b-4b3b-853f-833e338db9ac","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"たぶんそういう違いはなさそうな感じでしたねw\n歴史的経緯はありそうな予感がしている。例えば昔は `linenr_T` は環境によって int だったり long だったりしたけど今は long 固定になったとか…調べてないので想像ですが","ts":"1624147517.134100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SgL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"836e4a80-1fea-462d-9709-5013057ce876","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"内部行と表示行みたいに、どっかに概念のレイヤ境界があって、しれっと受け渡ししている可能性とかもありそうだけど、ちょっといやんですね","ts":"1624145430.133100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NOKFU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae361612-2d08-44ba-97c2-5fc29d3dbf12","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そう言えば今回パッチ書いてて、行番号を表す変数の型が `linenr_T` だったり `long` だったりして統一されてないのが気になった。 `linenr_T` の定義は long なので中身は同じなのだけど","ts":"1624144847.132100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jf6z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7fd857c3-fee3-4baf-9162-3fdc212cb0c8","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"\u0026gt; 2fb749568 2021-06-19 21:38:25 +0200 =?UTF-8?q?Dundar=20G=C3=B6c?=: patch 8.2.3020: unreachable code\n最新パッチの author がなんかおかしい。メールのヘッダから取ってきてる?","ts":"1624144724.130700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X8Zh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"022451a8-e375-4c69-8748-fde4877429e5","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"thincaさんのパッチ入りましたね","ts":"1624133300.129800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tada","count":5,"users":["U03C71D7H","UGHD6GP16","U9S4G0LJW","U01H161HVPS","UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a/cbG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78e763c2-3196-4247-bef0-f97b18233cbe","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim/vim/commit/6864efa59636ccede2af24e3f5f92d78d210d77b\u003e","ts":"1624133272.129200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MU51"}]}]
